                            <a href="/Catalog/Detalles"><img src="https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/isbn/9780132350884-L.jpg" class="card-img-top p-3 book-cover-img" alt="Clean Code"></a>
                            <div class="card-body p-2">
                                <a href="/Catalog/Detalles" class="text-decoration-none"><h6 class="card-title text-truncate mb-0 text-amazon-blue">Clean Code</h6></a>
                                <p class="text-muted small mb-1">Robert C. Martin</p>
